Package: educationsurveyindia
Title: Access Indian National Sample Survey Education Microdata
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", , "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Query India's National Sample Survey (NSS) 80th round
    Comprehensive Modular Survey on Education (CMS-E, 2025) unit-level
    microdata on household, person and erstwhile-member education
    participation and expenditure, through 'DuckDB' views over 'Parquet'
    files built from the official release. Also downloads every NSS
    education survey round (1986-87 to 2025) from the Ministry of
    Statistics and Programme Implementation ('MoSPI') microdata portal
    <https://microdata.gov.in>.
